# purpose: malformed lines - every ERROR variant, and the order in which a line's problems are reported.
# exercises: unknown-command (verb echoed as written), bad-arguments, bad-account-id, bad-amount,
#            bad-currency; precedence unknown verb > arity > arguments left to right; malformed lines
#            between accepted ones never advance <seq>; whitespace and comments are tolerated.

OPEN alice USD
deposit alice 5
Deposit alice 5
DEPOSITT alice 5
DEPOSIT alice 5
OPEN
OPEN alice
OPEN alice USD extra
DEPOSIT alice 5 5
DEPOSIT alice
BALANCE
BALANCE alice alice
DEPOSIT alice 5

# arguments, left to right
DEPOSIT Alice 5
DEPOSIT alice_1 5
DEPOSIT a2345678901234567890123456789012x 5
DEPOSIT alice 1.005
DEPOSIT alice 5,00
DEPOSIT alice five
DEPOSIT alice .5
DEPOSIT alice 5.
DEPOSIT Alice 1.005
DEPOSIT alice 5

# currency tokens: shape is checked here, support is checked later
OPEN bob usd
OPEN bob US
OPEN bob USDD
OPEN Bob USD
OPEN bob XXX
OPEN bob EUR

# odd spacing is fine
   WITHDRAW    alice     2.50   
	DEPOSIT	bob	1
# an unknown verb is an unknown verb, whatever follows it
TRANSFERR alice bob 1
withdraw alice 1
WITHDRAW alice
WITHDRAW alice -1
BALANCE alice
BALANCE bob
